<title>PERU: Cementos Lima mulls cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Cementos Lima mulls cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Directors of Peru's largest cement-maker, Cementos Lima, will decide Thursday on a proposed cash dividend of $0.18 per common share and 0.018 sol per labor share, the Lima bolsa said Monday.</p>
<p>The market's daily report added that the dividend payment, taken from profits so far in 1997, would total $5.99 million.</p>
<p>(( -- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
